On behalf of the United States of America, I extend my warmest wishes to the people of the Kingdom of Thailand for a joyous Songkran and a New Year filled with renewal, health, and prosperity.

The United States deeply values our enduring friendship and alliance with Thailand. This Songkran, we also extend our congratulations to the new Thai government, and we look forward to working closely together to make Thailand and America safe, strong, and prosperous.

Happy Songkran and Happy Thai New Year!